{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org\/","@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/news\/2026\/09\/18\/wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo\/#Article","url":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/news\/2026\/09\/18\/wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo\/","inLanguage":"en-US","mainEntityOfPage":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/news\/2026\/09\/18\/wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo\/","headline":"Aussies Can Play World of Warcraft: Forever Early by Eating Maccas","description":"Aussies Can Play World of Warcraft: Forever Early by Eating Maccas Access the World of Warcraft: Forever Beta by Redeeming MyMaccas points.","articleBody":"I thought the Heroes of the Storm revival would be the biggest \u201cthat wasn\u2019t on my bingo card\u201d moment of the week following its surprise announcement at BlizzCon 2026. It\u2019s been swiftly trumped, however, by my discovery that you can redeem access to the World of Warcraft: Forever Beta by spending 1000 MyMaccas Rewards points in the McDonald\u2019s app in Australia.    Yep, you can apparently exchange your hard-earned McMoney for a trip back to 2004 Azeroth.        The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta kicks off this Thursday, 17 September 2026 AEST and runs until 22 October 2026 AEST. If you don\u2019t eat enough McNuggets, or you do but are too liberal with spending your MyMaccas Rewards points to part with another 1000 of them, there are a couple of other ways to get involved:     \tPre-purchase the Skyborne Epic Pack for $96.00 for guaranteed access, OR   \tClick here to opt in for the chance to gain access    If you're rich in MyMaccas Rewards points, like I pretend not to be, you have until 11:59 pm AEST on 20 October 2026 to redeem your points for one beta access coded, while supplies last.    It's easier than removing the pickles from your cheeseburger after asking for no pickles!     \tOpen the MyMacca\u2019s app and select Rewards &amp; Deals.   \tScroll down to Partner Rewards.   \tChoose the reward and redeem it using 1000 points.   \tCopy the unique code shown in the app.   \tCreate a new Battle.net account or log into your existing Battle.Net account.   \tClick on Account and then click Redeem Code.   \tEnter your unique code and follow the prompts to activate your beta access.    1000 points is less than half the cost of a single soft serve cone, so if you've been sitting on a mountain of MyMaccas points, waiting for your chance to use them to save the world, Azeroth awaits, Hero!","datePublished":"2026-09-18T10:11:37+10:00","dateModified":"2026-09-18T10:11:37+10:00","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Camilla Wolfe","description":"I love achievement hunting, competitive FPS, horror games (and movies), and I've been maining the same human paladin in WoW since I was 15.","url":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/author\/camillawolfe\/","sameAs":["@CharlieWh1skey","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/camillawolfe\/"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/e568354250da8e70b79fc49a1875439700076dafd4dd244700378660b165bca1?s=96&d=mm&r=g","height":96,"width":96}},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Camilla Wolfe","description":"I love achievement hunting, competitive FPS, horror games (and movies), and I've been maining the same human paladin in WoW since I was 15.","url":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/author\/camillawolfe\/","sameAs":["@CharlieWh1skey","https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/camillawolfe\/"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/e568354250da8e70b79fc49a1875439700076dafd4dd244700378660b165bca1?s=96&d=mm&r=g","height":96,"width":96}},"keywords":"blizzard, mcdonalds, World of Warcraft, World of Warcraft: Forever, ","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Press Start Australia","url":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/PS-LOGO-1.png","width":302,"height":60}},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https:\/\/press-start.com.au\/news\/2026\/09\