									<div class="share-it share-it-4 share-it-bold share-it-count-1 share-it-before"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpress-start.com.au%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F18%2Fwow-forever-mcdonalds-promo%2F" class="tipi-tip tipi-tip-move share-button share-button-fb" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Share" data-title="Share" target="_blank"><span class="share-button-content tipi-vertical-c"><i class="tipi-i-facebook"></i></span></a><a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?via=pressstartau&#038;text=Aussies%20Can%20Play%20World%20of%20Warcraft%3A%20Forever%20Early%20by%20Eating%20Maccas%20-%20https%3A%2F%2Fpress-start.com.au%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F18%2Fwow-forever-mcdonalds-promo%2F" class="tipi-tip tipi-tip-move share-button share-button-tw" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Tweet" data-title="Tweet" target="_blank"><span class="share-button-content tipi-vertical-c"><i class="tipi-i-twitter"></i></span></a><a href="https://reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpress-start.com.au%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F18%2Fwow-forever-mcdonalds-promo%2F" class="tipi-tip tipi-tip-move share-button share-button-re" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Submit" data-title="Submit" target="_blank"><span class="share-button-content tipi-vertical-c"><i class="tipi-i-reddit-alien"></i></span></a><a href="whatsapp://send?text=Aussies Can Play World of Warcraft: Forever Early by Eating Maccas – https%3A%2F%2Fpress-start.com.au%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F18%2Fwow-forever-mcdonalds-promo%2F" class="tipi-tip tipi-tip-move tipi-xl-0 share-button share-button-wa" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Share" data-title="Share"><span class="share-button-content tipi-vertical-c"><i class="tipi-i-whatsapp"></i></span></a><a href="fb-messenger://share/?link=https%3A%2F%2Fpress-start.com.au%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F18%2Fwow-forever-mcdonalds-promo%2F&app_id=1396891853863990" class="tipi-tip tipi-tip-move tipi-xl-0 share-button share-button-msg" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Share" data-title="Share"><span class="share-button-content tipi-vertical-c"><i class="tipi-i-messenger"></i></span></a></div>												<div class="entry-content body-color clearfix link-color-wrap">
																										<p>I thought the Heroes of the Storm revival would be the biggest “<em>that wasn’t on my bingo card</em>” moment of the week following its surprise announcement at BlizzCon 2026. It’s been swiftly trumped, however, by my discovery that you can redeem access to the World of Warcraft: Forever Beta by spending 1000 MyMaccas Rewards points in the McDonald’s app in Australia.</p>
<p>Yep, you can apparently exchange your hard-earned McMoney for a trip back to 2004 Azeroth.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-attachment-id="170134" data-permalink="https://press-start.com.au/news/2026/09/18/wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo/attachment/screenshot-8/" data-orig-file="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg" data-orig-size="1204,940" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access&lt;/p&gt;
" data-large-file="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-600x468.jpg" loading="lazy" class="alignnone wp-image-170134 size-full" src="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg" alt="MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access" width="1204" height="940" srcset="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg 1204w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-300x234.jpg 300w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-600x468.jpg 600w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-770x601.jpg 770w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-500x390.jpg 500w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-254x198.jpg 254w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-731x571.jpg 731w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1204px) 100vw, 1204px" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-attachment-id="170134" data-permalink="https://press-start.com.au/news/2026/09/18/wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo/attachment/screenshot-8/" data-orig-file="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg" data-orig-size="1204,940" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access&lt;/p&gt;
" data-large-file="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-600x468.jpg" class="alignnone wp-image-170134 size-full" src="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg" alt="MyMaccas WoW: Forever Beta Access" width="1204" height="940" srcset="https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236.jpg 1204w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-300x234.jpg 300w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-600x468.jpg 600w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-770x601.jpg 770w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-500x390.jpg 500w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-254x198.jpg 254w, https://press-start.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_3238-e1789687764236-731x571.jpg 731w" sizes="(max-width: 1204px) 100vw, 1204px" /></noscript></p>
<p>The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta kicks off this Thursday, 17 September 2026 AEST and runs until 22 October 2026 AEST. If you don’t eat enough McNuggets, or you do but are too liberal with spending your MyMaccas Rewards points to part with another 1000 of them, there are a couple of other ways to get involved:</p>
<ul>
<li>Pre-purchase the <a href="https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-forever?pfm=fran-wow-forever-masthead-shop-prepurchase-warcraft-forever&amp;_gl=1*rty8f*_ga*MjA0Nzg4NjY5NC4xNzg3NDUzOTcw*_ga_VYKNV7C0S3*czE3ODk1NDMwNTUkbzMkZzEkdDE3ODk1NDMyODQkajUxJGwwJGgw">Skyborne Epic Pack</a> for $96.00 for guaranteed access, OR</li>
<li>Click <a href="https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-gb/forever#blz-optin-1">here</a> to opt in for <em>the chance</em> to gain access</li>
</ul>		<!-- Start DFP Ad -->
		<div id="ad-repeater-middle-170133--desktop" class="ad ad-repeater-middle-170133--desktop"></div>
		<div id="ad-repeater-middle-170133--mobile" class="ad ad-repeater-middle-170133--mobile"></div>

		<script>
			googletag.cmd.push(function() {
				var headerBiddingSlots = [];

				if (!isMobile){
					var desktopSlot = googletag.defineSlot('/6773/o.press-start/zibs', [300, 250], 'ad-repeater-middle-170133--desktop')
					.setTargeting('site', ['press-start'])
					.setTargeting('pos', ['2'])
					.setTargeting('post', ['170133'])
					.setTargeting('cat', ['news']).setTargeting('cat1', ['2026']).setTargeting('cat2', ['09']).setTargeting('cat3', ['18']).setTargeting('cat4', ['wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo']).addService(googletag.pubads());
					headerBiddingSlots.push(desktopSlot);

					googletag.display('ad-repeater-middle-170133--desktop');
				}else{
					var mobileSlot = googletag.defineSlot('/6773/m.press-start/zibs', [[320, 50],[320, 100],[300, 250]], 'ad-repeater-middle-170133--mobile')
					.setTargeting('site', ['press-start'])
					.setTargeting('pos', ['2'])
					.setTargeting('post', ['170133'])
					.setTargeting('cat', ['news']).setTargeting('cat1', ['2026']).setTargeting('cat2', ['09']).setTargeting('cat3', ['18']).setTargeting('cat4', ['wow-forever-mcdonalds-promo']).addService(googletag.pubads());
					headerBiddingSlots.push(mobileSlot);

					googletag.display('ad-repeater-middle-170133--mobile');
				}

				var sendAdServerRequest = failsafeHandler(
					function(slots){
						googletag.pubads().refresh(slots);
					},
					headerBiddingSlots
					);
				pbjs.que.push(function() {
					pbjs.rp.requestBids({
						callback: sendAdServerRequest,
						gptSlotObjects: headerBiddingSlots
					});
				});
				setTimeout(sendAdServerRequest, 3500);

				// Pass ad slots to setupAdRefresh
				setupAdRefresh(headerBiddingSlots);
			});
		</script>
		<!-- End DFP Ad -->
		<div class="block-da-1 block-da block-da-post_middle_content da-style-1 clearfix"></div></tipimidc>
<p>If you&#8217;re rich in MyMaccas Rewards points, like I pretend not to be, you have until 11:59 pm AEST on 20 October 2026 to redeem your points for one beta access coded, while supplies last.</p>
<div style="clear:both; margin-top:0em; margin-bottom:1em;"><a href="https://press-start.com.au/features/2026/09/13/blizzcon-2026-announcements/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" class="u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca"><!-- INLINE RELATED POSTS 1/1 //--><style> .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca { padding:0px; margin: 0; padding-top:1em!important; padding-bottom:1em!important; width:100%; display: block; font-weight:bold; background-color:#C0392B; border:0!important; border-left:4px solid #464646!important; text-decoration:none; } .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca:active, .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca:hover { opacity: 1; transition: opacity 250ms; webkit-transition: opacity 250ms; text-decoration:none; } .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca { transition: background-color 250ms; webkit-transition: background-color 250ms; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 250ms; webkit-transition: opacity 250ms; } .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca .ctaText { font-weight:bold; color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration:none; font-size: 16px; } .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca .postTitle { color:#FFFFFF; text-decoration: underline!important; font-size: 16px; } .u637618ab03a0f2f42381eaff017ec8ca:hover .postTitle { text-decoration: underline!important; } </style><div style="padding-left:1em; padding-right:1em;"><span class="ctaText">RELATED:</span>&nbsp; <span class="postTitle">Everything Announced At The BlizzCon 2026 Opening Ceremony</span></div></a></div><p>It&#8217;s easier than removing the pickles from your cheeseburger after asking for no pickles!</p>
<ul>
<li>Open the MyMacca’s app and select Rewards &amp; Deals.</li>
<li>Scroll down to Partner Rewards.</li>
<li>Choose the reward and redeem it using 1000 points.</li>
<li>Copy the unique code shown in the app.</li>
<li>Create a new Battle.net account or log into your existing Battle.Net account.</li>
<li>Click on Account and then click Redeem Code.</li>
<li>Enter your unique code and follow the prompts to activate your beta access.</li>
</ul>
<p>1000 points is less than half the cost of a single soft serve cone, so if you&#8217;ve been sitting on a mountain of MyMaccas points, waiting for your chance to use them to save the world, Azeroth awaits, Hero!</p>


